UID:20260922-UnitedNationsGeneralAssemblythegeneralde@nyc-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260827T132941Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260922
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260923
SUMMARY:United Nations General Assembly: the general debate opens
DESCRIPTION:The high-level general debate of the 81st session runs Sept. 
 22-26 and concludes Monday\, Sept. 28\; the session itself opened Sept. 
 8. Leaders' week is the year's largest security and traffic event in Mid
 town. The order of speakers is published by the United Nations only shor
 tly beforehand\, so who appears on which day is not yet known.\n\nhttps:
 //www.un.org/en/ga/81/meetings/
URL:https://www.un.org/en/ga/81/meetings/
CATEGORIES:city-life
END:VEVENT
