DTSTAMP:20260827T132941Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:Mail ballots must be postmarked or returned
DESCRIPTION:Completed mail ballots must be postmarked\, or returned in pe
 rson\, by Election Day.\n\nhttps://elections.ny.gov/registration-and-vot
 ing-deadlines
